# Documentation discipline

Documentation must stay aligned as the codebase and agent workflows evolve.

## Gate

Before opening a draft PR or ending an implementation handoff, complete a **documentation pass** unless skipped per [documentation-after-implement.mdc](documentation-after-implement.mdc).

Do **not** open a draft PR until the pass completes or the user explicitly skips.

